        "TileImage": "$($repository 80500733-547d-4b65-9868-bf07a5e1f3d0).Image",
        "Description": "Good Evening, 47. \r\rEveryone talks about how evil the higher-ups at Kronstadt Industries are, but no one dares to wonder how despicable the lower-level security, engineers, or associated press members could potentially be. Our contractor has hired you to kill 5 low-profile targets that could be mean or even worse.\r\rClean house, 47, and make it a scene.\r\rBy Jimmy Nutrition (as Diana)",
